        "guard:b3->c2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the schedule is satisfactory, write a ticket order to SNCF."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural convergence points merging satisfactory paths back to the ticket order step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10",
